Playdock Steam integration

Steam hooks, Wine detours, overlay support, and launcher helpers were adapted
from NotProtonNot/NotProton c3a49486 under GPL-3.0 and are included in Playdock's
source. Playdock owns setup, runtime paths, per-game controls, and recovery.
https://github.com/NotProtonNot/NotProton

Five Wine/Steamworks adapters are vendored from NotProton 1.0.3. Authored source,
pinned dependency fetchers, and rebuild scripts accompany Playdock's source.
lsteamclient uses the Steamworks SDK License (LICENSE.lsteamclient).
steam-shim uses BSD-3-Clause (LICENSE.steam-shim) and Steamworks SDK headers.
It also uses OpenVR (BSD-3-Clause), Wine (LGPL-2.1), and JsonCpp
(public domain / MIT); their original notices remain in the corresponding source.
Dobby is Apache-2.0 (Dobby.txt). cJSON is MIT (cJSON.txt).
CrossOver and Valve client components retain their providers' licenses.
